---
const appCardsImg =
  'https://songdeck.shop/cdn/shop/files/App___Cards_Mockup_Transparent_Background_kopie.png?v=1727967749&width=1070';
---

<section class="sk-section sk-section--paper" id="how">
  <div class="sk-wrap">
    <div style="max-width:640px">
      <p class="sk-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="sk-h2">Draw. Scan. <em>Play.</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="sk-steps">
      <div class="sk-step">
        <span class="sk-step-num">1</span>
        <h3>Draw a card</h3>
        <p>
          With a question in mind, or none at all. Sit with the illustration and the title, then
          read the card's message.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-step">
        <span class="sk-step-num">2</span>
        <h3>Scan the back</h3>
        <p>
          Every card carries a QR code. The free Songdeck app reads it and finds the song that
          belongs to your card.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-step">
        <span class="sk-step-num">3</span>
        <h3>Let it play</h3>
        <p>Listen once through. Then, if you like, join it — softly counts too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sk-ways">
      <div class="sk-ways-panel">
        <h3>Five ways to meet a card</h3>
        <p>Each card is an invitation into Authentic Singing. Mix and match:</p>
        <ul class="sk-ways-list">
          <li><span class="way-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Simply listening</li>
          <li><span class="way-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Humming or chanting along</li>
          <li><span class="way-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Making sound freely</li>
          <li>
            <span class="way-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Singing out loud — even if you think
            you can't
          </li>
          <li><span class="way-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Moving your body to the music</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="sk-ways-tip">
          A tip printed inside the lid: connect a speaker. The songs deserve more than a phone on
          a table.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="sk-ways-media">
        <img
          src={appCardsImg}
          alt="A hand holding a phone running the Songdeck app, playing the card 'There is Joy in My Voice', next to the card itself"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>
          The app is the record player — free, for iPhone and Android.
        </figcaption>
        <p class="sk-app-note">
          It plays whatever you scan, keeps your favourites for the days the box is elsewhere,
          and can send a song to someone who doesn't own a deck.
        </p>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
